Target-fuel-specific result-shaped scoped source block bridge.

This is the exact-fuel counterpart of `SourceResultBlockRunBridge`, used by
structured statement constructors whose target semantics runs the selected
body at the statement subfuel.  It remains source-owned: no stack slots,
cleanup depths, return tokens, or direct backend frames appear here.
