/--
Exact-fuel scoped block bridge for a loop body that exits with `break`.

Loop bodies are the one place where a nonregular source mode becomes a regular
result for the surrounding construct.  Naming the break-only body contract keeps
that Yul control-flow rule explicit and still source-owned.
