/--
General bounded target for the recursive imported-Yul source bridge.

The final proof should construct this package by induction over source fuel,
with structural recursion for statement lists.  Unlike the dispatcher-specific
facade, this is intentionally polymorphic in the source layout, compiler source
context, source statement/block, and code override, so nested blocks, function
bodies, and dispatcher bodies can all use the same recursive theorem.
-/
