/--
Compose a compiler-generated source prelude with one terminal statement.

This is the source-tower terminal analogue of the expression-prelude bridge:
the imported source run is supplied once, the generated prelude is proved as a
regular source run, and the terminal suffix is appended without exposing stack
slots or direct procedure-frame details.
-/
theorem sourceResultBlockRunBridge_terminalStackPrelude_of_exec
    {cfg : StateRelConfig} {layout : List Name}
