/--
Sound-level wrapper for generated terminal preludes.

Concrete imported-Yul terminal cases only need to explain how their source run
produces the argument-evaluation fact and terminal observation relation.  The
compiler-side prelude execution, stack-order argument adapter, and terminal
suffix composition are discharged here at the stack-free source boundary.
